---
description: Require changelog updates for shipped code changes
alwaysApply: true
---

# Changelog Required

- For every user-requested code change that affects behavior, API, UX, or developer workflow, update `CHANGELOG.md` in the same task.
- Add entries under `## [Unreleased]` using the existing section style (`Added`, `Changed`, `Fixed`).
- Include issue/ticket references when available (for example: `GFG-184`).
- Keep entries concise and user-facing; avoid internal-only noise.
- If a change is intentionally excluded from changelog, explicitly state why in the response.
